00:14:14,117 --> 00:14:20,117
Catch-22 is a war, comedy film directed by Mike Nichols.

3
00:21:21,176 --> 00:21:27,176
A WWII military pilot makes a valiant effort to be certified
insane in order to be excused from flying missions.

4
00:28:28,235 --> 00:28:34,235
But there's a catch.

5
00:35:35,294 --> 00:35:41,294
Capt. John Yossarian, played by Alan Arkin.

6
00:42:42,352 --> 00:42:48,352
Col. Cathcart, played by Martin Balsam.

7
00:49:49,411 --> 00:49:55,411
Maj. Danby, played by Richard Benjamin.

8
00:56:56,470 --> 00:57:02,470
Capt. Nately, played by Art Garfunkel.

9
